+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on a password hashing algorithm. A decision record for this topic (`config/decisions/revoke-password-hashing.json`) existed earlier in the project's history, but it was removed from the repository in a later commit ("move decision config out of the tree"), and no replacement record has been added since, so nothing is currently on file to state as the project's choice.
